WEBVTT

00:09.926 --> 00:11.928
You're a part of the Union now!

00:12.012 --> 00:15.348
- So do what I fucking tell you, okay?
- You better fucking answer him!

00:15.432 --> 00:17.642
- Got it?
- Good to see you, hyeong-nim!

00:18.226 --> 00:19.728
Good evening!

00:20.562 --> 00:22.689
What the fuck is this, an organized gang?

00:23.773 --> 00:25.567
Don't speak to me, or get your ass kicked.

00:26.151 --> 00:28.737
The neighbors will file noise complaints,
you fucking idiots.

00:28.820 --> 00:29.988
Sorry, sir.

00:34.451 --> 00:36.369
Drop your head, you fucking asshole.

00:39.706 --> 00:40.749
Stand up straight!

00:47.297 --> 00:48.339
Hello.

00:48.423 --> 00:50.175
- Hello.
- You're here.

01:06.107 --> 01:07.776
What the hell are you glaring at?

01:09.027 --> 01:10.028
Go inside.

01:35.136 --> 01:36.179
Just a minute.

01:41.392 --> 01:42.811
I'm saying this once.

01:44.938 --> 01:46.022
Listen up.

01:48.399 --> 01:52.529
I don't care what Park Hu-min
and all the rest of you are up to.

01:54.322 --> 01:56.241
And I didn't need to be brought here.

01:59.869 --> 02:03.498
But… I'm here
to make this clear to you all.

02:08.920 --> 02:11.589
If you step foot
near Su-ho's hospital again…

02:15.635 --> 02:16.845
you are all dead.

02:18.805 --> 02:20.765
I will certainly kill all of you.

02:40.493 --> 02:43.163
Separate the variable first
to solve it quickly.

02:45.206 --> 02:48.418
A variable with a fixed range is
no different from a constant.

02:48.501 --> 02:50.587
MATHEMATICS

02:55.967 --> 02:57.218
Keep your word.

02:59.012 --> 03:00.847
If you do, no one will get hurt.

03:05.059 --> 03:07.187
I want you to stop hanging around Hu-min.

03:10.440 --> 03:11.441
Sure.

03:13.151 --> 03:14.319
Understood.

03:16.362 --> 03:17.780
And you keep your word.

03:40.178 --> 03:45.350
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

04:44.450 --> 04:45.368
Hey.

04:53.001 --> 04:54.585
Don't look at me like that,

04:55.503 --> 04:57.213
or I'll gouge out both your eyes.

05:14.188 --> 05:16.149
Do you enjoy looking at that?

05:25.658 --> 05:27.160
We're just letting him go?

05:32.081 --> 05:33.833
Then why did you ask me to bring him?

05:41.591 --> 05:42.967
Do I have to explain it?

05:50.850 --> 05:53.644
I mean, why are you
so fucking obsessed with Eunjang?

05:56.189 --> 05:58.566
It's not like they'll bring us big money.

05:59.817 --> 06:03.905
And you already know you can't own him,
not with power. Right?

06:06.824 --> 06:09.369
That's why I need to make him
come here on his own.

06:13.873 --> 06:16.084
Did you send the boys
to Hu-min's restaurant?

06:17.085 --> 06:19.629
44, 45, 46, 47…

06:19.712 --> 06:21.839
LIFE'S TOUGH
BUT IT'S OKAY. I'M TOUGH TOO

06:21.923 --> 06:24.467
…48, 49, 50, 51,

06:24.550 --> 06:27.261
52, 53, 54…

06:27.345 --> 06:30.014
DAD

06:30.723 --> 06:31.766
Five more!

06:32.266 --> 06:34.727
50, 60, 70,

06:34.811 --> 06:37.146
80, 90, 100.

06:37.230 --> 06:38.648
Ah!

06:42.568 --> 06:43.653
Yes, abeoji?

06:43.736 --> 06:45.613
- Are you kidding?
- It's Officer Han.

06:45.696 --> 06:47.698
- Liars!
- Your dad got into trouble again.

06:47.782 --> 06:49.826
Come and calm him down, okay?

06:49.909 --> 06:53.830
How the fuck was I supposed to know
if it was real or fake? Tell the truth!

06:53.913 --> 06:55.832
- Calm down.
- We can talk about it.

06:55.915 --> 06:58.793
- Douchebags! Tell them the truth!
- Hey. Please calm down.

06:58.876 --> 06:59.919
- Stop!
- I will kill you!

07:00.002 --> 07:01.087
- Keep the kids quiet.
- Sorry.

07:01.170 --> 07:03.297
- Sir, calm down.
- Abeoji, you need to stop.

07:03.381 --> 07:05.007
Come on. Please stop!

07:06.342 --> 07:07.468
You little brat.

07:08.010 --> 07:09.595
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
- It's okay.

07:09.679 --> 07:11.389
What are you sorry for, you punk?

07:11.472 --> 07:13.224
You didn't do anything wrong!
Why apologize?

07:13.307 --> 07:15.059
Abeoji, please!

07:15.143 --> 07:19.439
Sir, I understand,
but we still need to fill out a report.

07:20.022 --> 07:21.732
There are protocols
for situations like this.

07:21.816 --> 07:24.694
I even checked their IDs!
They weren't fucking minors!

07:24.777 --> 07:27.655
- I checked their goddamn photos!
- We can talk at the station.

07:27.738 --> 07:30.158
You did sell alcohol
to underage students though, right?

07:30.241 --> 07:31.409
Fucking seriously…

07:31.492 --> 07:33.536
- Man!
- Let's go. All right?

07:34.245 --> 07:35.288
Uh-huh.

07:35.371 --> 07:37.415
Officer Kim, get them in the car too.

07:37.498 --> 07:38.666
Hey! Get in the car!

07:39.584 --> 07:43.045
- Come on, let's go. Hurry up.
- I'm walking. Jeez, man.

07:43.129 --> 07:44.422
Stop pushing me.

07:44.505 --> 07:47.633
Hey. Baek-jin hyeong
asked me to tell you this.

07:47.717 --> 07:48.759
"I miss you."

07:59.812 --> 08:03.649
NA BAEK-JIN

08:14.952 --> 08:16.037
Where are you?

08:16.954 --> 08:17.955
Tomorrow.

08:19.290 --> 08:20.541
I'll send the address.

08:27.089 --> 08:29.175
Stop running!

08:35.848 --> 08:37.099
Keep your word.

08:41.354 --> 08:43.105
If you do, no one will get hurt.

08:51.906 --> 08:54.283
Lower your stance a little more.

08:54.367 --> 08:56.994
Keep looking straight ahead.
Yeah, that's it.

08:57.078 --> 09:00.540
That's right. It'll feel more natural
after about a hundred times.

09:00.623 --> 09:02.458
Good. Nice.

09:04.669 --> 09:07.630
- Oh… Yeon Si-eun.
- Si-eun.

09:08.506 --> 09:11.300
What brings you here?
Are you joining our club?

09:12.510 --> 09:15.846
Well, if you want to join, you'll have
to go through a vigorous tryout process.

09:15.930 --> 09:17.223
I met Na Baek-jin.

09:18.891 --> 09:20.101
The kid in the Union.

09:21.561 --> 09:22.603
You what?

09:26.941 --> 09:29.193
Na Baek-jin, that crazy asshole.

09:29.277 --> 09:30.319
Hey, did…

09:31.404 --> 09:32.613
did anything happen?

09:33.531 --> 09:34.615
Nothing happened.

09:36.701 --> 09:40.288
I don't care what you guys do or who with.
Leave me out of it.

09:42.290 --> 09:43.332
Si-eun-a,

09:44.041 --> 09:45.960
wh… what's with you all of a sudden?

09:46.043 --> 09:48.212
I don't have the free time
like you guys do.

09:48.296 --> 09:51.507
I've got a lot of things to do.
You can have fun without me.

09:52.341 --> 09:54.552
What the hell are you talking about?

09:55.052 --> 09:57.430
Did we ever ask you to hang out with us?

09:57.513 --> 09:58.514
Exactly.

09:59.599 --> 10:01.267
So let's just ignore each other.

10:05.187 --> 10:06.897
Okay.

10:06.981 --> 10:08.441
I get what you're saying.

10:12.903 --> 10:13.904
Let's do that.

10:15.906 --> 10:17.825
Let's ignore each other from now on.

10:19.535 --> 10:20.578
We good?

10:21.996 --> 10:22.997
Yes.

10:38.971 --> 10:40.014
Si-eun-a.

10:48.189 --> 10:51.567
Something's making Baku act
like this on purpose, right?

10:51.651 --> 10:52.735
And you too?

10:56.572 --> 10:59.408
I have, um, no idea what happened to you,

11:00.868 --> 11:02.995
but I know Baku didn't mean what he said.

11:03.788 --> 11:05.498
You don't need to worry about it.

11:08.167 --> 11:09.752
- Jun-tae-ya.
- Yes?

11:15.800 --> 11:16.801
I just…

11:20.763 --> 11:22.431
I'm more comfortable alone.

11:37.655 --> 11:38.656
…is so.

11:38.739 --> 11:42.451
Now, that's for transformers,
which is a typical example

11:42.535 --> 11:43.869
of mutual induction.

11:43.953 --> 11:45.830
Let's take a look at another example.

12:04.682 --> 12:06.267
Huh? One second.

12:08.018 --> 12:09.061
Hey, Eunjang.

12:14.400 --> 12:15.568
Where are your friends?

12:23.826 --> 12:26.954
Wait, didn't Baek-jin tell us
to leave this kid alone?

12:27.538 --> 12:28.789
He did?

12:29.999 --> 12:31.041
Let's just go.

12:34.920 --> 12:36.297
Shit.

12:36.964 --> 12:38.215
Where's Seong-je?

12:39.091 --> 12:40.885
Don't know. He said he'd come by later.

12:52.772 --> 12:54.857
Jun-tae, where's Si-eun?

12:54.940 --> 12:57.318
He left right after
the end-of-day announcements.

12:57.401 --> 12:58.402
He left?

13:00.780 --> 13:02.823
Man, what is wrong with him?

13:04.575 --> 13:05.951
Have you talked to him at all?

13:07.077 --> 13:07.953
No.

13:09.079 --> 13:10.080
But, I mean,

13:11.457 --> 13:13.709
I'm not sure, but I think I have an idea.

13:15.419 --> 13:18.130
I don't think Si-eun meant
what he said either.

13:24.428 --> 13:26.388
I'll take off first. See you tomorrow.

13:26.889 --> 13:27.932
Hey, man.

13:28.432 --> 13:30.601
You aren't gonna meet up
with Na Baek-jin, are you?

13:31.560 --> 13:32.937
It's nothing like that.

13:33.437 --> 13:35.064
Get home safe. See ya later.

13:37.358 --> 13:38.776
Then where are you going?

13:38.859 --> 13:40.861
To Buil Girls' High. Hot date.

13:57.461 --> 13:58.462
Let's go.

14:02.299 --> 14:03.551
Call Seong-je.

14:11.100 --> 14:12.977
Where could it be?

14:13.060 --> 14:15.813
I dropped my toy here, somewhere.

14:23.779 --> 14:25.281
It's been a while.

14:30.119 --> 14:31.245
How's your knee?

14:36.417 --> 14:38.878
What brings you to this neighborhood?

14:39.378 --> 14:42.089
Wait, where's the newbie guy?
Yeon Si-eun, right?

14:42.756 --> 14:44.425
I thought it'd be fun to play with him.

14:44.508 --> 14:45.509
Is it fun

14:47.094 --> 14:48.762
to play Na Baek-jin's minion?

14:51.015 --> 14:52.057
It is.

14:53.142 --> 14:55.185
I get to beat the hell out of you shits.

15:00.357 --> 15:02.818
You fucking counting?
There's obviously four.

15:05.154 --> 15:06.447
You're my playmate.

15:08.198 --> 15:10.951
What? You scared?

15:11.035 --> 15:12.119
Go, Jun-tae.

15:13.913 --> 15:14.914
Huh?

15:15.456 --> 15:17.458
Hurry up and get out of here, you idiot!

15:21.795 --> 15:23.339
You're so freaking cool.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.674
You son of a bitch. Hey!

15:27.426 --> 15:29.929
- Hey, fuck you.
- Get back here, you little bitch!

15:30.930 --> 15:32.681
What a load of bullshit.

15:40.314 --> 15:41.774
Instead of this place,

15:42.483 --> 15:44.276
let's go somewhere quiet.

15:48.405 --> 15:49.865
Lose that glare,

15:50.824 --> 15:52.201
you fucking loser.

15:55.287 --> 15:56.705
Tiny little shit!

15:59.458 --> 16:01.460
Where you running to, asshole?

16:01.543 --> 16:03.128
- Hey!
- You!

16:06.006 --> 16:07.341
Hey, you fucking idiot!

16:08.884 --> 16:10.010
Hey, asshole!

16:11.136 --> 16:12.262
Little piece of shit!

16:14.348 --> 16:15.516
Stop running!

16:21.188 --> 16:22.564
- Go that way.
- Okay.

16:27.486 --> 16:29.446
Fuck.

16:30.864 --> 16:31.907
Hey, Seong-je.

16:32.866 --> 16:34.326
I have to find one more kid?

16:35.494 --> 16:36.578
Yeon Si-eun?

16:37.204 --> 16:39.790
Damn, I let him go earlier.

16:40.666 --> 16:41.667
On it.

16:52.052 --> 16:53.220
PARK HU-MIN

16:54.430 --> 16:57.099
The number you have dialed
is not available. Pl--

17:13.574 --> 17:16.076
SEO JUN-TAE
MISSED CALL

17:16.160 --> 17:20.456
SEO JUN-TAE:
ARE YOU ON YOUR WAY TO HAGWON?

17:46.732 --> 17:47.816
Oh, hello?

17:48.984 --> 17:51.195
- Hey, Si-eun-a.
- What is it? This is random.

17:53.197 --> 17:56.408
Oh, I was wondering if you
made it okay to your cram school.

17:59.161 --> 18:00.954
Why did you suddenly want to know that?

18:02.372 --> 18:03.373
Uh…

18:05.000 --> 18:09.630
I was honestly just wondering
if you made it to the cram school.

18:10.756 --> 18:12.049
That's why I called.

18:13.592 --> 18:14.718
Mm-hmm.

18:14.802 --> 18:15.886
- Oh no.
- Hey!

18:16.887 --> 18:18.555
Si-eun-a, don't worry, I'm fine.

18:18.639 --> 18:20.224
- Go straight home after.
- Finally.

18:20.307 --> 18:21.558
Hello? Seo Jun-tae?

18:21.642 --> 18:23.852
Why'd you keep running?

18:23.936 --> 18:25.646
Bro, fuck you!

18:25.729 --> 18:27.773
- Lift up your head.
- Lift it, bitch.

18:34.571 --> 18:36.657
- Damn, I thought I'd win.
- It's the best outfit I have.

18:36.740 --> 18:39.201
So close, man. All right,
this time I'm gonna win all the money.

18:39.284 --> 18:41.495
- All right, one more. One more.
- Give me a smoke.

18:41.578 --> 18:43.122
- I just quit.
- Okay, just one more.

18:43.205 --> 18:44.456
We aren't open yet.

18:48.210 --> 18:49.795
Where's Baek-jin?

18:50.462 --> 18:52.798
- "Baek-jin"?
- "Baek-jin"?

18:54.007 --> 18:56.051
He called him Baek-jin.

18:56.135 --> 18:58.095
Oh, wow, this guy's freakin' nuts.

18:58.178 --> 18:59.346
Legit. Whatever, man.

18:59.429 --> 19:01.598
Hey, isn't he Park Hu-min?

19:02.558 --> 19:04.143
- Park Hu-min?
- Who's that?

19:04.226 --> 19:07.187
- Sounds familiar.
- He runs the show at Eunjang High.

19:07.271 --> 19:09.356
- He's Park Hu-min?
- Keep playing cards.

19:09.439 --> 19:11.859
- Wow, he's really something.
- I mean, it's…

19:12.734 --> 19:13.777
Fuck.

19:19.950 --> 19:21.118
Na Baek-jin.

19:22.452 --> 19:23.662
Where is he?

19:31.628 --> 19:32.838
It's been a while.

19:56.570 --> 19:58.030
Park Hu-min.

19:59.448 --> 20:01.408
I still think of you as a good friend.

20:07.456 --> 20:10.083
Joining the Union isn't
a bad offer for you to take.

20:11.543 --> 20:12.711
It'll be worth it.

20:13.837 --> 20:16.256
Turning into a sound business
once we graduate.

20:17.424 --> 20:19.176
Everything is planned out.

20:27.726 --> 20:30.395
I've come to realize that
you're a freaking dumbass.

20:37.486 --> 20:38.487
Hey.

20:39.780 --> 20:41.073
Stupid dickhead.

20:44.743 --> 20:47.996
Do you really not know
why I want no part in all this bullying?

20:50.582 --> 20:52.584
Or are you just pretending not to know?

20:57.256 --> 20:58.465
I just…

21:01.760 --> 21:03.595
hate your fucking guts.

21:15.565 --> 21:18.110
You're the dumbass here,
not me, you got that?

21:22.531 --> 21:24.366
What the fuck did you do this time?

21:27.327 --> 21:28.954
Is Go Hyun-tak doing well?

21:49.891 --> 21:50.726
Hey. Hey.

21:54.896 --> 21:56.481
Baek-jin said you can leave?

21:57.441 --> 21:58.483
I highly doubt that.

21:59.609 --> 22:01.236
I don't have time to waste.

22:02.654 --> 22:03.947
Let's get this over with.

22:33.143 --> 22:36.104
Your punches are still so weak. Huh?

22:39.775 --> 22:40.776
You asshole.

22:48.367 --> 22:49.993
Damn!

22:56.875 --> 22:59.127
Hey, we're not done yet.

22:59.211 --> 23:00.921
Get up, you fucking moron.

23:03.965 --> 23:05.550
Fucking shit.

23:07.594 --> 23:09.471
- Fuck you.
- Come on.

23:11.765 --> 23:12.766
Fuck you.

23:18.980 --> 23:19.981
Keep going?

23:20.065 --> 23:22.401
- Fuck you. Hey, hey, hey!
- Shit.

23:22.484 --> 23:24.569
Oh God.

23:24.653 --> 23:26.196
Hey! Fuck you!

23:26.279 --> 23:27.489
Shit!

23:27.989 --> 23:29.366
Fuck you!

23:30.534 --> 23:32.160
You goddamn fuck!

23:37.249 --> 23:38.500
Fuck you!

23:46.466 --> 23:47.801
Can I go yet?

23:53.515 --> 23:55.308
That's enough.

24:02.524 --> 24:04.067
That's enough. Let him go.

24:06.611 --> 24:09.156
Take a good look
and get a grasp on the situation.

24:10.157 --> 24:12.159
See how long you'll be able to hold out.

24:17.080 --> 24:18.081
Hey.

24:20.417 --> 24:22.961
You're not doing me a favor
by letting me leave.

24:24.838 --> 24:26.506
It's quite the opposite.

24:28.800 --> 24:30.594
I just about killed everyone here.

24:45.817 --> 24:46.902
Damn it!

24:54.659 --> 24:57.537
Hey, I heard Hyun-tak
went to fight Seong-je.

24:57.621 --> 25:00.957
Hyun-tak is fucking screwed.
I heard Seong-je was a total psycho.

25:01.041 --> 25:03.585
- Want to watch? I got the address.
- No, thanks.

25:03.668 --> 25:04.961
- I don't wanna die.
- Hey.

25:20.018 --> 25:21.353
Stop it!

25:21.436 --> 25:23.104
Get over here. Hey.

25:23.188 --> 25:24.439
This little guy's adorable.

25:25.023 --> 25:27.025
- Look at this little shit.
- Stop it!

25:27.108 --> 25:29.110
- Fucking idiot.
- Stop it.

25:29.194 --> 25:31.863
Please stop!

25:32.447 --> 25:33.823
Oh, fuck this.

25:34.533 --> 25:36.993
Oh!

25:42.040 --> 25:43.458
Hey, you fucker!

25:57.889 --> 25:58.807
Glasses.

25:59.474 --> 26:01.977
Are you okay, Hyun-tak?

26:06.106 --> 26:08.775
It's time for a photo. Look over here.

26:10.318 --> 26:13.947
One, two, three. Hey, dumb fucks.

26:14.614 --> 26:16.616
Look over here.

26:18.702 --> 26:20.287
Are… are you sad?

26:21.705 --> 26:23.290
Should I beat him some more?

26:25.000 --> 26:26.209
Let's wrap this up.

26:27.377 --> 26:31.089
Give me a big smile, all right.
One, two, three. Say "Kimchi!"

26:48.023 --> 26:49.274
Newbie!

26:53.486 --> 26:55.530
I missed you.

27:00.910 --> 27:02.537
Today is so fun.

27:03.079 --> 27:06.708
Ooh, is it my birthday?
Maybe I should buy a lottery ticket.

27:17.761 --> 27:21.097
You gonna stab me with this?

27:37.781 --> 27:39.616
You're just a fucking wuss.

27:41.201 --> 27:42.327
I'm getting bored.

27:46.790 --> 27:47.791
Fuck you.

28:27.080 --> 28:28.957
Damn it!

28:36.089 --> 28:37.674
Fuck you!

28:42.053 --> 28:43.930
Release, you stupid…

29:08.246 --> 29:09.247
Yeah, that's it.

29:37.984 --> 29:39.068
Come here!

29:54.501 --> 29:55.877
Hey, hey, hey!

30:07.180 --> 30:08.640
Fuck you!

30:10.475 --> 30:12.310
Let go of me, you bitch!

30:22.529 --> 30:24.572
Fuck you.

30:50.139 --> 30:52.392
You fucking moron.

30:54.102 --> 30:56.062
Get up, you fucking bastard.

30:56.938 --> 30:57.814
Fuck you, bitch.

31:13.913 --> 31:15.164
So this will

31:15.999 --> 31:17.917
only end after I kill you, right?

32:18.102 --> 32:20.271
Yeon Si-eun. Yeon Si-eun. You okay?

32:20.355 --> 32:21.356
Yeon Si-eun!

32:28.988 --> 32:30.198
Su-ho-ya.

32:33.409 --> 32:35.119
I got into another fight.

32:40.041 --> 32:41.751
I'm sorry.

33:00.520 --> 33:03.856
Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick…

33:31.092 --> 33:31.968
Pouring…

33:36.556 --> 33:38.349
Puffin', I'll figure it out…

33:41.060 --> 33:42.103
I know that…

33:44.897 --> 33:48.192
Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick…

33:59.579 --> 34:02.957
Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick…

34:15.762 --> 34:17.513
I don't know how to go home again…

34:26.606 --> 34:29.025
The window shows another conscience
You can't find me…

34:32.653 --> 34:34.447
